Data source: The data were kindly provided by Johanna Amberger from their study: Amberger, J., R Fendel and H. Stremmel (2017), ?Improved output gaps with financial cycle information? An application to G7 countries? new Keynesian Phillips curves?, Applied Economics Letters, 24(4), 219-228. 

More details about the construction of the variables can be found in the Applied Economics Letters paper.



